{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miners in the Mountain</strong> is a pixel-art card RPG that blends &quot;Scavenge-Fight-Extract&quot; gameplay. Here, almost everything is a card\u2014except for materials and gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll use cards to battle enemies, loot supplies, establish outposts in the mines, and delve deeper into the abyss. Be warned: failure costs you everything\u2014food, parts, teammates... everything. Encounter diverse characters; some will join your cause, others will stand in your way. Build your exploration deck and never lose sight of your ultimate goal: the <strong>&quot;Heart of the Mountain&quot;</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras/e294ecc30f277864fccd862cdc64af20.avif?t=1772784932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras_big/e294ecc30f277864fccd862cdc64af20.webp?t=1772784932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who am I? Where am I?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were found deep within a vein, rescued by &quot;Iron Head&quot; of the Black Tower Society. No one in camp seems to know you, and your past is a blank slate. Yet, one obsession remains clear: a promise to find the Heart of the Mountain. To whom did you make this promise? You don't know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras/2ae3bfeaad61ce8816b2e0b430d14ef2.avif?t=1772784932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras_big/2ae3bfeaad61ce8816b2e0b430d14ef2.avif?t=1772784932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;Where am I going?&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;Didn't you say you're looking for the Heart of the Mountain?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Squad, Tread Carefully</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks in every corner of the mines. Bizarre creatures and hostile strangers alike will strike without warning. Rely on your supplies and teammate cards to blaze a trail toward the mountain's depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras/0a417c575f5014107dd2bebbd99fa109.avif?t=1772784932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras_big/0a417c575f5014107dd2bebbd99fa109.avif?t=1772784932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;Where is the Heart of the Mountain?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> \u2014 &quot;Further down.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Establish Markets, Trade Resources</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival requires massive resources, necessitating cooperation between underground outposts. Use your &quot;Mine Coins&quot; to trade for materials, gear, food, and even labor. If you\u2019re broke, take a look at the game\u2019s title... and get to work (physically).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras/e3a42a630ef0dfa7c6fc88dd0d876eb1.avif?t=1772784932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras_big/e3a42a630ef0dfa7c6fc88dd0d876eb1.webp?t=1772784932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;Why do you NPCs have so much dynamite?&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;Rules of the underground: don't ask questions you don't want the answer to.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Wrong Move, Lose It All</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every descent could be your last. Remember, failure means losing everything\u2014food, parts, teammates... all of it. Keep backup supplies in your camp warehouse, or face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras/01c68cc1e704092a2d74cccf4e7b516a.avif?t=1772784932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras_big/01c68cc1e704092a2d74cccf4e7b516a.webp?t=1772784932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;What happens if I fail?&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;You die, and you meet the Mountain Spirit. Even if you're lucky enough to crawl back, your gear and crew aren't coming with you.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Delve Deeper, Unveil the Secret</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you penetrate the deepest reaches of the mine, you will encounter bizarre anomalies and forgotten lore. At the end of the journey, the secret of the &quot;Heart of the Mountain&quot; awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras/77de5cbc5e2f0b88363f26269a02fa5d.avif?t=1772784932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras_big/77de5cbc5e2f0b88363f26269a02fa5d.avif?t=1772784932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;Who are you?&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;I am the Mountain Spirit. And I am not.&quot;</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2696010?t=1772784932","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/538569261afdb96f3c3691c5dc7ebdf549b390bd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772784932","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/437f4af451aabd95c7c0fad29e4f9e2d6da602da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772784932","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/437f4af451aabd95c7c0fad29e4f9e2d6da602da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772784932","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There are occasionally mild inappropriate content and adult humor in the character dialogues."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miners in the Mountain</strong> is a pixel-art card RPG that blends &quot;Scavenge-Fight-Extract&quot; gameplay. Here, almost everything is a card\u2014except for materials and gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll use cards to battle enemies, loot supplies, establish outposts in the mines, and delve deeper into the abyss. Be warned: failure costs you everything\u2014food, parts, teammates... everything. Encounter diverse characters; some will join your cause, others will stand in your way. Build your exploration deck and never lose sight of your ultimate goal: the <strong>&quot;Heart of the Mountain&quot;</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras/e294ecc30f277864fccd862cdc64af20.avif?t=1772784932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras_big/e294ecc30f277864fccd862cdc64af20.webp?t=1772784932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who am I? Where am I?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were found deep within a vein, rescued by &quot;Iron Head&quot; of the Black Tower Society. No one in camp seems to know you, and your past is a blank slate. Yet, one obsession remains clear: a promise to find the Heart of the Mountain. To whom did you make this promise? You don't know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras/2ae3bfeaad61ce8816b2e0b430d14ef2.avif?t=1772784932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras_big/2ae3bfeaad61ce8816b2e0b430d14ef2.avif?t=1772784932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;Where am I going?&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;Didn't you say you're looking for the Heart of the Mountain?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Squad, Tread Carefully</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks in every corner of the mines. Bizarre creatures and hostile strangers alike will strike without warning. Rely on your supplies and teammate cards to blaze a trail toward the mountain's depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras/0a417c575f5014107dd2bebbd99fa109.avif?t=1772784932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras_big/0a417c575f5014107dd2bebbd99fa109.avif?t=1772784932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;Where is the Heart of the Mountain?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> \u2014 &quot;Further down.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Establish Markets, Trade Resources</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival requires massive resources, necessitating cooperation between underground outposts. Use your &quot;Mine Coins&quot; to trade for materials, gear, food, and even labor. If you\u2019re broke, take a look at the game\u2019s title... and get to work (physically).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras/e3a42a630ef0dfa7c6fc88dd0d876eb1.avif?t=1772784932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras_big/e3a42a630ef0dfa7c6fc88dd0d876eb1.webp?t=1772784932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;Why do you NPCs have so much dynamite?&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;Rules of the underground: don't ask questions you don't want the answer to.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Wrong Move, Lose It All</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every descent could be your last. Remember, failure means losing everything\u2014food, parts, teammates... all of it. Keep backup supplies in your camp warehouse, or face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras/01c68cc1e704092a2d74cccf4e7b516a.avif?t=1772784932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras_big/01c68cc1e704092a2d74cccf4e7b516a.webp?t=1772784932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;What happens if I fail?&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;You die, and you meet the Mountain Spirit. Even if you're lucky enough to crawl back, your gear and crew aren't coming with you.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Delve Deeper, Unveil the Secret</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you penetrate the deepest reaches of the mine, you will encounter bizarre anomalies and forgotten lore. At the end of the journey, the secret of the &quot;Heart of the Mountain&quot; awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras/77de5cbc5e2f0b88363f26269a02fa5d.avif?t=1772784932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/extras_big/77de5cbc5e2f0b88363f26269a02fa5d.avif?t=1772784932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;Who are you?&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 &quot;I am the Mountain Spirit. And I am not.&quot;</i></p>","developers":["Stone Gut"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696010/c4f5daff6ad428fd2134dabc578ae66dcb111805/header.jpg?t=1772784932","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2696010/852565/eb567e25a5a05539ef86ab0d4fc3ec0e4be98c2c/1750892025/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742278374","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2696010/852565/eb567e25a5a05539ef86ab0d4fc3ec0e4be98c2c/1750892025/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742278374","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2696010/852565/eb567e25a5a05539ef86ab0d4fc3ec0e4be98c2c/1750892025/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742278374","id":257115390,"name":"PV-EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap